{"id": "185533", "name": "נגזרות חלקיות קיימות והפונקציה לא רציפה – xy/(x²+3y²)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נגדיר פונקציה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x,y)&nbsp; \\)</span> באופן הבא:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\( f(x,y)=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{cc}{{CT:0}} &amp; (x,y)\\neq (0,0) \\\\0 &amp; (x,y)=(0,0)\\end{array}\\right. \\)</p><p>הגרף של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x,y)\\)</span> נראה כך:</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"data/185533/files/1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"516\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"></p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p><strong>מצאו את הנגזרות החלקיות של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x,y)\\)</span> ואת ערכן בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((0,0)\\)</span>:</strong></p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}(x,y)=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}(x,y)=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}(0,0)=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}(0,0)=\\) [[input:ans4]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans4]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">(כדי להקליד אינסוף, הקלידו <code dir=\"ltr\">inf</code>, ועל מנת להקליד מינוס אינסוף, הקלידו <code dir=\"ltr\">minf</code>. אם הנגזרת לא קיימת הקלידו <code dir=\"ltr\">nd</code>)</p><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\"><u>שימו לב</u>: תשובתכן תוצג כפי שהמערכת מבינה אותה. אנא ודאו שהיא נראית כמצופה.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>האם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x,y)\\)</span> רציפה ב- <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^2\\)</span>?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans5]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans5]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מחוץ לראשית גוזרים לפי כלל המנה; בראשית מחשבים את הנגזרות החלקיות מההגדרה; את הרציפות בודקים בעזרת שני מסלולים לראשית.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הנגזרות החלקיות מחוץ לראשית</b><br>מחוץ לראשית המכנה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x^2+3y^2\\)</span> אינו מתאפס, וגוזרים לפי כלל המנה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(\\frac{u}{v}\\right)'=\\frac{u'v-uv'}{v^2}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}=\\frac{y\\,(x^2+3y^2)-xy\\cdot 2x}{(x^2+3y^2)^2}={{CT:1}} \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}=\\frac{x\\,(x^2+3y^2)-xy\\cdot 6y}{(x^2+3y^2)^2}={{CT:2}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הנגזרות החלקיות בראשית, מההגדרה</b><br>בראשית אי אפשר להציב בנוסחאות (המכנה מתאפס), ולכן משתמשים בהגדרה. על הצירים הפונקציה מתאפסת: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(h,0)=\\frac{h\\cdot 0}{h^2}=0\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(0,h)=\\frac{0\\cdot h}{3h^2}=0\\)</span>. לכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}(0,0)=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(h,0)-f(0,0)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{0}{h}=0,\\qquad \\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}(0,0)=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(0,h)-f(0,0)}{h}=0 \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — רציפות</b><br>מחוץ לראשית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span> היא מנה של פולינומים עם מכנה שונה מאפס, ולכן רציפה. בראשית נבדוק שני מסלולים. לאורך הציר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y=0\\)</span> הפונקציה שווה ל-0, ולאורך הישר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y=x\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(t,t)=\\frac{t\\cdot t}{t^2+3t^2}=\\frac{1}{4}\\xrightarrow[t\\to0]{}\\frac14 \\]</p>שני מסלולים לראשית נותנים גבולות שונים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(0\\ne\\frac14\\right)\\)</span>, ולכן הגבול בראשית אינו קיים, והפונקציה אינה רציפה ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\((0,0)\\)</span>. לכן היא <b>אינה רציפה</b> ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^2\\)</span>, אף על פי ששתי הנגזרות החלקיות קיימות בראשית.<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}(0,0)=\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}(0,0)=0,\\qquad \\lim_{t\\to0}f(t,t)=\\frac14\\ne f(0,0) \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]] [[feedback:prt2]] [[feedback:prt3]] [[feedback:prt4]] [[feedback:prt5]]", "prtcorrect": "<p>Correct answer, well done.</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p>Your answer is partially correct.</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p>Incorrect answer.</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 25, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 25, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "boolean", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 2, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "fx", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}\\)\\((x,y)\\) is correct.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}\\)\\((x,y)\\) is incorrect.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "fy", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}\\)\\((x,y)\\) is correct.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}\\)\\((x,y)\\) is incorrect.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Correct answer, \\(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}\\)\\((0,0)=0\\)</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Incorrect answer. By definition<p style=\"text-align:center\">\\( \\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}\\)\\( (0,0)=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\frac{f(h,0)-f(0,0)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\frac{h \\cdot0}{h^2}=0 \\)</p></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt4", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans4", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt4-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Correct answer, \\(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}\\)\\((0,0)=0\\)</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt4-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Incorrect answer. By definition<p style=\"text-align:center\">\\( \\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}\\)\\( (0,0)=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\frac{f(0,h)-f(0,0)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\frac{0 \\cdot h}{3h^2}=0 \\)</p></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt5", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans5", "tans": "false", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt5-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Well done! Indeed \\(f(x,y)\\) isn't continuous at \\((0,0)\\).<br>By taking the path \\((t,t)\\) when \\(t→0\\) we get<p style=\"text-align:center\">\\( \\lim_{t\\to 0}\\frac{ t\\cdot t}{t^2+3t^2}=\\lim_{t\\to 0}\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{1}{4}\\neq f(0,0) \\)</p><strong>Notice, </strong>\\(f(x,y)\\) is an example for a function which has both partial derivatives at \\((0,0)\\) and they are equal, but \\(f(x,y)\\) itself isn't continuous.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt5-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Incorrect answer! Note that \\(f(x,y)\\) isn't continuous at \\((0,0)\\)<br>By taking the path \\((t,t)\\) when \\(t→0\\) we get<p style=\"text-align:center\">\\( \\lim_{t\\to 0}\\frac{ t\\cdot t}{t^2+3t^2}=\\lim_{t\\to 0}\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{1}{4}\\neq f(0,0) \\)</p><strong>Notice, </strong>\\(f(x,y)\\) is an example for a function which has both partial derivatives at \\((0,0)\\) and they are equal, but \\(f(x,y)\\) itself isn't continuous.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["f", "fx", "fy"], "nvariants": 1}